cff-version: 1.2.0
title: control-probe
message: "If you use control-probe in research or control assurance work, please cite it."
type: software
authors:
  - name: control-probe contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/control-probe/control-probe"
url: "https://github.com/control-probe/control-probe"
license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-13
abstract: >-
  control-probe is a public template for turning digital asset control
  requirements into executable evidence. It evaluates structured control
  specifications against deterministic fixtures or read-only EVM state,
  applies stress scenarios, and emits JSON plus Markdown evidence suitable
  for engineering review, CI policy gates, and institutional control testing.
keywords:
  - control testing
  - compliance automation
  - digital assets
  - evidence generation
  - institutional infrastructure
  - reserve assurance
  - risk controls
  - stablecoins
  - tokenization
  - web3 infrastructure
